# SkillMaxx

> SkillMaxx is an independent directory of {{ skills.length }} agent skills, plugins and MCP servers. Each listing shows install commands and compatibility for Claude Code, Codex, Grok Build, Cursor and Pi, based on official docs and sandboxed install tests ({{ testing.pass }} of {{ testing.total }} tests passed in the latest run). Data checked {{ site.checked }}.

How we test: we pull add-ons from public lists (official Claude Code, Codex and Grok Build marketplaces, MCP reference servers, npm), run the real install command in each supported agent's CLI in a clean sandbox with no credentials, re-run nightly (retrying each failed install once and calling something broken only after two failing nights), and publish pass/fail with a log excerpt for every result. Latest run {{ testing.runDate }}: {{ testing.addons }} add-ons, {{ testing.total }} install tests, {{ testing.pass }} passed, {{ testing.fail }} failed. Limits: tested only in agents that support that add-on type; "pass" means it installs and loads, not that every feature was exercised.

Statuses: "Tested" = installed and loaded by our harness in a sandbox with no credentials; "Verified from docs" = an official source documents the install; "Failed" = the hands-on check didn't pass; "Not yet tested" = no docs or test yet.

